-1\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, ${x}_{1}\\cdot {x}_{2}\\cdot {x}_{3}=2\\cdot (-3)\\cdot (-1)=6.$" 13194139533417 17592186045585 true] [17592186315066 1068 #edb/ref 17592186314122 13194139533417 17592186045585 true] [17592186315066 1068 #edb/ref 17592186314441 13194139533417 17592186045585 true] [17592186315066 1069 "q-341179" 13194139533417 17592186045585 true] [17592186315066 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045486 13194139533417 17592186045585 true] [17592186315066 1071 "Find ${f}^{′}(x)$ for $f(x)=\\frac{{3}^{x}}{arccsc\\,x}.$\n\n${f}^{′}(x)=$\n{{field-1}} \n$\\frac{1}{arccsc\\,x}\\,+$\n{{field-2}}\n$\\frac{1}{|x|{(arccsc\\,x)}^{2}}.$" 13194139533417 17592186045585 true] [17592186315066 1072 #uuid "61288950-c35e-5f57-a1be-6d007672017d" 13194139533417 17592186045585 true] [17592186315066 1074 "Here, we let $u(x)={3}^{x}$ and $v(x)=arccsc\\,x,$ and apply the quotient rule.\n\nWe use the formulae\n\n$$\n{u}^{′}(x)={3}^{x}\\operatorname{ln}⁡3\\,\\text{and}\\,{v}^{′}(x)=-\\frac{1}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}.\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(x) & =\\frac{{u}^{′}(x)\\cdot v(x)-u(x)\\cdot {v}^{′}(x)}{[v(x)]^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{({3}^{x}\\operatorname{ln}⁡3)\\cdot arccsc\\,x-{3}^{x}\\cdot (-\\frac{1}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}})}{{(arccsc\\,x)}^{2}}. \\\\  & ={3}^{x}\\operatorname{ln}⁡3\\cdot \\frac{arccsc\\,x}{{(arccsc\\,x)}^{2}}+\\frac{{3}^{x}}{{(arccsc\\,x)}^{2}}\\cdot \\frac{1}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}} \\\\  & ={3}^{x}\\operatorname{ln}⁡3\\,\\frac{1}{arccsc\\,x}+\\frac{{3}^{x}}{\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}\\,\\frac{1}{|x|{(arccsc\\,x)}^{2}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533417 17592186045585 true] [17592186315067 1068 #edb/ref 17592186314023 13194139533417 17592186045585 true] [17592186315067 1069 "q-341190" 13194139533417 17592186045585 true] [17592186315067 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 13194139533417 17592186045585 true] [17592186315067 1071 "Given that for $s>\\omega ,$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}L{\\operatorname{sinh}⁡(\\omega t)}=\\frac{\\omega }{{s}^{2}-{\\omega }^{2}},\